2026-10-20T05:38:13.6600469Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6603498Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6604404Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6605229Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6606156Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6607030Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6607770Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6628276Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6630893Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6635447Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6636923Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6663228Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6664180Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6673755Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6690124Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6690900Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6703472Z PASS a discovered root CONTAINING an explicit root is dropped (explicit wins)
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6704476Z PASS an unrelated discovered root is untouched by that drop
2026-10-20T05:38:13.6725859Z PASS a discovered root INSIDE an explicit root is dropped too
